Hi,
Here’s more detail regarding the ad sponsorship opportunity. An ad helps support the local church while keeping your business in front of hundreds of nearby families attending Mass each week. It is a great way to build consistent visibility and become a familiar name in the community.
We currently have sponsorship space available at several churches near your business. This gives us the flexibility to review the different locations and find the church—or combination of churches—that best fits the area and customers you want to reach.
Ad Sponsorship Term: Annual (52 weeks or shorter) – Free Ad Design and 4 ad changes per year.

Digital Bundle: Includes digital ad on the church website. Parishesonline.com
 
Ad Sizes and Annual Rates: Secure your space by 8/31/2026 to receive a discount up too 25% off.
 
Basic Sponsorship (1 SPACE) $669 per year. Our most compact and efficient option. At about half the size of a standard business card, it’s a perfect entry point. It ensures your name is consistently seen by the community every single week while linking directly to your website.
 
Premium Sponsorship (2 SPACE) $1,110 per year.  This is our "Business Card" tier. By doubling the real estate of the Basic ad, you gain the space needed for a professional logo and a clear call to action. It offers a familiar, professional look that fits perfectly into the community's weekly reading habit.
 
Executive Sponsorship (3 SPACE) $1,541 per year. This 3-space ad is the "Wide-Angle" choice. The horizontal layout provides a unique visual break from the smaller ads around it. This extra width allows for more descriptive text or a larger team photo, helping you tell a more complete story about your services.
 
Deluxe Sponsorship (4 SPACE) $1,962 per year. Our most popular and best-value tier. At double the size of a business card, this ad truly dominates the page. It includes a premium digital presence and enough room for high-resolution headshots, multiple logos, and a custom QR code to drive instant traffic to your booking page or menu.
 
Legacy Sponsorship (6 SPACE) $2,698 per year. The ultimate community presence. 



